SUMMARY:Timmy No Brakes LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260706T042015Z
DTSTART:20260708T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nTimmy No 
	Brakes is one of stand-up comedy’s most electrifying rising stars\, known 
	for his unhinged\, high-energy delivery and fearlessly unfiltered humor. H
	is comedy style blends sharp observational wit with chaotic storytelling t
	hat keeps audiences on the edge of their seats — and laughing uncontrollab
	ly. \nWith a rapidly growing fanbase built through viral clips and relentl
	ess touring\, Timmy No Brakes has established himself as a must-see live a
	ct. His performances are raw\, unpredictable\, and packed with the kind of
	 honest comedy that resonates deeply with audiences of all backgrounds. \n
	Whether you’ve been following him for years or are discovering him for the
	 first time\, a Timmy No Brakes show is an experience you won’t forget. Ex
	pect big laughs\, big energy\, and zero brakes. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wed
	nesday\, July 8\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915
	 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Restriction: 18+ / 2 Beve
	rage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $38 – $54 \nAbout the Venue\nCobb’s Come
	dy Club is one of San Francisco’s most beloved and storied comedy venues\,
	 located in the heart of the North Beach neighborhood at 915 Columbus Aven
	ue. With a capacity of around 400 guests\, Cobb’s offers an intimate yet l
	ively atmosphere that puts every seat close to the stage. \nThe club featu
	res a full bar and dining service\, so you can enjoy food and drinks throu
	ghout the show. The room is set up with tables and chairs in a classic com
	edy club layout\, ensuring great sightlines from virtually every seat. Par
	king is available in nearby garages\, and the venue is easily accessible b
	y public transit. \nCobb’s has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy 
	over its decades-long history\, making it a legendary destination for stan
	d-up fans in the Bay Area. The energy inside is always electric\, and the 
	staff is known for creating a welcoming\, fun environment for every show. 
	\nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up performance by Timmy No Brakes —
	 a full evening of his signature brand of comedy. Expect a high-energy\, f
	ast-paced show filled with hilarious stories\, sharp observations\, and mo
	ments of pure comedic chaos. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and 
	is recommended for adult audiences. The 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage
	 minimum are in effect\, so come ready to enjoy a drink (or two) while you
	 laugh the night away. \nDoors typically open 30–45 minutes before showtim
	e. Arrive early to grab a good seat and settle in before the laughs begin.
	 \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $54 (before taxes and fees)\nTic
	kets are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale)
	. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. W
	e may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/timmy-no-brakes-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calen
	dar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/timmy-no-brakes-live-at-cobbs-comedy-c
	lub/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, Califor
	nia\, 94133\, United States Of America
